[GOAL] Goal: in `allTwo`
    ╭─[ goals/bool-constant-branches.sw:11:69 ]
    │
 11 │ theorem allTwo (b: Bool) (c: Bool): List.all [b, c] (x => x) = b := ?
    │                                                                     ┬  
    │                                                                     ╰── b: Bool
    │                                                                         c: Bool
    │                                                                         ⊢ (b && c && True) = b
    │ 
    │ Note: this statement is false; a counterexample:
    │         b = True
    │         c = False
    │       `[b, c].all (x => x) = b` is false:
    │         left:  False
    │         right: True
────╯
[GOAL] Goal: in `anyTwo`
    ╭─[ goals/bool-constant-branches.sw:13:69 ]
    │
 13 │ theorem anyTwo (b: Bool) (c: Bool): List.any [b, c] (x => x) = b := ?
    │                                                                     ┬  
    │                                                                     ╰── b: Bool
    │                                                                         c: Bool
    │                                                                         ⊢ (b || c || False) = b
    │ 
    │ Note: this statement is false; a counterexample:
    │         b = False
    │         c = True
    │       `[b, c].any (x => x) = b` is false:
    │         left:  True
    │         right: False
